--- !u!114 &8593660874260105286
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1186200116332627704}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Mr. Frost
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2b4559edf5c8e4127bd24c2716d92d08, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9bd67081bcb644affa62515237e51041, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Mr. Frost
    sets: met:Mr. Frost
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: B-b-b-brr! H-hello there! Mr. Frost, snowman, at your service. Pardon the chattering. It's been winter on Frostpeak for three hundred years.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Aren't snowmen supposed to like the cold?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: We like it c-cool! Not this cold! My poor carrot's gone numb. What I need is a scarf. A big, warm, woolly scarf!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Granny Purl knits the finest scarves on the mountain. She's just by the campfire there. But she's all out of yarn, and so am I.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Barnaby Badger sells yarn at his stall in Hollyhock, by the castle. Fetch a ball of it, {hero}, take it to Granny Purl, and bring me the scarf. Brrr! I'll be right here. I can't feel my feet to leave.
  - requires: has:warm_scarf
    notIf: thanked:frost
    sets: thanked:frost
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: snow_hat
    takeItem: warm_scarf
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A SCARF! A red one! Oh, it's warm. It's WARM! I can feel my carrot again!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'You''ve made a snowman very happy, {hero}. Here, take this: a Snow Hat, the warmest hat on the mountain. It''s got a pom-pom!'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: And in return, a song! Ahem.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: "\u266A Oh, I'm a little snowman, round and white and neat, with a carrot for a nose and a scarf to keep me sweet! \u266A"
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: "\u266A And when the winter's over, I won't melt away, I'll sit here by the campfire, and I'll sing to you all day! \u266A"
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: That was lovely.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Thank you! I wrote it myself. It took three hundred years.
  - requires: cleared:Frost4
    notIf: frost:cheered
    sets: frost:cheered
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Did you feel that? The whole mountain just let out its breath! The Snow Yeti's himself again!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: And he's left you the Rainbow Chalk. Draw with it on a rainbow post, and a bridge of colour appears across the chasm. There are chasms like that all over Gemhold, I hear.
  - requires: 
    notIf: thanked:frost
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Br-brr... a ball of yarn from Barnaby Badger in Hollyhock, then Granny Purl knits it, then the scarf's mine. I mean, ours. Mine. B-brr!
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: "\u266A Oh, I'm a little snowman, round and white and neat... \u266A Oh! I've forgotten the rest. Give me a minute. It'll come."
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: What do you call a snowman in the summer?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: What?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A PUDDLE! Hahaha! ...Please don't tell me that's what happens.
  - requires: thanked:frost
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Warm as toast! Well. Warm as a snowman. Cool, but cosy.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Careful on the ice, {hero}. You keep going after you stop. Like a sleepy cat on a polished floor.
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 269227981007129164}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: -1474698522, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1709180717, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -114973718, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -499299003, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: 406865600, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 631357096, guid: 1d4e9e01d8d504024a9db2ab91620ec1, type: 3}
